  <item>
    <title>014 时隔9年港澳之约（内含香港银行卡办理指南）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67af268c05a90dfd0d7c6265</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67af268c05a90dfd0d7c6265</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 14 Feb 2025 11:36:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj-2bmf99fRjG7a6jMUce02k4paT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 大家嚎，好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 时间过去了9年，这次我什么攻略都不做</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 住：住宿每天只花200元</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="228">03:48</a> 香港银行0门槛开户指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="515">08:35</a> 香港和澳门的摩托车环境太好了，羡煞我也</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">09:49</a> 暴言：摩托车和宠物不友好的超一线城市也只是三流超一线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 港澳的城市噪音怎么这么大啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="731">12:11</a> 全方位环绕看维多利亚港</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 行：天星小轮、叮叮车、双层巴士、缆车、TurboJet、港珠澳大桥穿梭车、港铁、澳门轻轨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="871">14:31</a> 食：添好运、兰芳园、顺德公、葡挞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1088">18:08</a> 两天的澳门日程，拍到了鸽生照片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1208">20:08</a> 路氹填海区，大受震撼的赌场区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1342">22:22</a> 感慨良多，大陆这九年没有超越港澳，如果行政还是管理而非服务思路，未来也不会超越。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6107defb0e42f151d863fa8f/lkqHKnQnt1KCYaLAw9X751MEys3B.m4a" length="45526543" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:23:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuOy2BUu0CLHxxMcdC-b9rMe39c-.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>013 AI编程用过了，未来知多少</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678fc72cc3617f02a4555f32</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678fc72cc3617f02a4555f32</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jan 2025 20:16:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期是一期快速录音，发完第二天早晨五点播主就要开车1000公里回老家了，所以本期是一刀未剪的版本。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>声音识别：</span></strong><br><span>主持人昕爷，电商创业者；</span><br><span>Nemo，人在美国的创业者；</span><br><span>位毛，自娱自乐的网上冲浪人。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 三个人在用哪些工具，主要做什么东西；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> 位毛用油猴脚本恢复简中互联网网页的冲浪秩序；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a> 昕爷有开发背景，用Cursor做跨境电商后台；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> anything to flomo，利用api同步内容到flomo；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> 使用AI Coding的具体优缺点；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="378">06:18</a> Nemo用Cursor写chrome插件；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="528">08:48</a> 位毛一年半以前用GPT完成了三个静态网站的上线；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a> 昕爷做电商后台的细节；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> 环境、发布，会是一个难点；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a> 对于AI Coding未来的看法，昕爷看好；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1818">30:18</a> 位毛主要关注普通人如何在这个浪潮里找到一块大木头不被淹死；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2071">34:31</a> Nemo对于AI Coding时代的成本计算逻辑有特别新的理解；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2238">37:18</a> 粗剪直接发了！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6107defb0e42f151d863fa8f/lpwERKun51IADw5aK9XNMmwbDgEy.m4a" length="72799723" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuOy2BUu0CLHxxMcdC-b9rMe39c-.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>012 读书会：乡下人的悲歌（美国80后副总统J.D.万斯）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6742b9ca8d1233fb0d8ce647</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6742b9ca8d1233fb0d8ce647</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Nov 2024 06:01:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期声音辨别：</span></strong><span>音质最好是位毛 / 杭普昕爷 / 标普Chris杨总 / 音质飘渺的是Nemo</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="21">00:21</a> 《乡下人的悲歌》书籍和作者简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> 本次嘉宾各自的出身介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">03:26</a> 原生家庭：白人穷人，主流叙事之外的人群</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> 儿童时期社会关系的变迁对小孩子的影响会持续终生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 社区、学校环境对人成长的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="779">12:59</a> 财商教育是过去两代人普遍缺失的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 父母教育水平决定了家庭认知上限</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">20:03</a> 马润（海军陆战队）是万斯的第一个人生转折点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1243">20:43</a> 关系网络带来的第二个人生转折点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1441">24:01</a> 全球化和逆全球化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1626">27:06</a> 纪录片《美国工厂》中关于全球化的「答案」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1861">31:01</a> 美式的贫穷，跟中式的贫穷完全不是一个级别的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2082">34:42</a> 认知层次的提高带来的人生收益最大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2345">39:05</a> 没电了，东方人睡觉，西方人起床，世界拜拜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkUk9v-v3gp9kJIYXI2MmQCiBNQG.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsnza1QnujZKYUhsByQHm7vEkZEq.m4a" length="81771544" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuOy2BUu0CLHxxMcdC-b9rMe39c-.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>011 位毛&amp;Nemo：聊贾樟柯《江湖儿女》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673869eef373fe5d4dbf80d2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673869eef373fe5d4dbf80d2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 16 Nov 2024 09:54:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 内容提要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="37">00:37</a> 自报家门，贾科长粉丝两枚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> 江湖儿女看起来有种美国西部片的观感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 贾导驾到伯克利某活动现场，与Nemo相见</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 江湖儿女浓缩了16年的时间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="184">03:04</a> 贾导讲述拍江湖儿女最难的部分：群演的状态</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">06:46</a> 暴言：好莱坞已经不出任何好电影了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">08:34</a> 为什么江湖儿女会让我有美式西部片的感觉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> Y.M.C.A. ！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="865">14:25</a> ヤクザ（YAKUZA）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> 过去黑道要黑，现在黑道要白</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> 越吹捧什么，越缺什么——江湖义气</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1332">22:12</a> 以油田搬迁推演库区搬迁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">31:55</a> 一起去电影院看贾导的《风流一代》吧</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmbkwO-EBOPwDSB2v_FHyKfdepb1.m4a" length="62673736" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuOy2BUu0CLHxxMcdC-b9rMe39c-.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>010 位毛&amp;司令&amp;书包：江湖不变，何处是岸？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672e56f443dc3a438722fe51</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672e56f443dc3a438722fe51</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 09 Nov 2024 02:49:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期请到了两位体制内的嘉宾聊很多人梦想中的「上岸」，但……</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期声音辨别：</span></strong><br><span>男的是位毛 / 「他给我眉毛修了」的是书包 / 「不上班也长痘」的是司令</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 片头与本期内容简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 三个人寒暄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> 《半泽直树》里的著名台词（好家伙寒暄了一分半）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">03:03</a> 位毛：中国是运行在潜规则之上的国家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">04:51</a> 书包：厚黑学无法通过理论学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 位毛：《火线THE WIRE》体制内的人可以看看美国体制内的电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="541">09:01</a> 司令：以终为始的工作期待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 世界是一场巨大的以工代赈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="797">13:17</a> 年轻一代啃老越来越普遍了，什么叫大人，什么叫小孩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="995">16:35</a> 位毛：我是怎么变成铁石心肠的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">20:03</a> 非创造型工作，加班就是燃烧生命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1436">23:56</a> 场面话、拍马屁の经验分享交流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1703">28:23</a> 位毛：职业标的物的概念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2141">35:41</a> 书包：自由是一种特权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2285">38:05</a> 司令：想到什么就去做，不想那么多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2532">42:12</a> 我们都爱独立创作者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2677">44:37</a> 慕强与厌蠢，可能和视角有关</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2867">47:47</a> 让大模型来替我们做难为情的事情吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2975">49:35</a> 司令：工作之外的几个支点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3263">54:23</a> 书包：工作之内找支点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3781">63:01</a> 结束在了莫名其妙的地方</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsKIqI2mTlhAyQVDSdjUjlXH3NOX.m4a" length="121902015" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuOy2BUu0CLHxxMcdC-b9rMe39c-.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>009 职场辅导变疏导：小厂总监和大厂专员的就业讨论</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6725012f33c798676fc563ae</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6725012f33c798676fc563ae</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 01 Nov 2024 17:07:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：位毛</span><br><span>本期嘉宾：Moran</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 想不到吧，有片头了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="33">00:33</a> 正文开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">01:16</a> 今天阿里不再是一个光环，很多公司避而不及</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="504">08:24</a> 91年的P6已经是「低潜力废物」了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="611">10:11</a> 60后享受了完整的国家红利，其他人都没那么幸运</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> 办公室工作的核心内容就是受辱，挣窝囊废</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 大厂话题有三宝：股票、汽车、新盘摇号，听着真烦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1113">18:33</a> 互联网行业享受了时代红利，应该抓住，但要清醒这是红利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> B站：创造快乐的地方工作不快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1464">24:24</a> 小影：稳住现金牛、做成唯一成功新项目、内部活动各种拿第一，但业绩永远是C</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1744">29:04</a> 优化事实的表达，是简历和面试中的重要手法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2263">37:43</a> 女性主管更没人性，本质上是因为女性本身遭遇的职场不公</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2708">45:08</a> Tim、梁建章、雷军：Leader和Manager的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2844">47:24</a> 考核是利益分配，没有真的公平</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3286">54:46</a> 今日金句</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3391">56:31</a> AGI如何提高个人职业能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3928">65:28</a> 给人时间，总会成长。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnfsoLVeXG--yRYgAJAKlZHPNVGO.m4a" length="128424027" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuOy2BUu0CLHxxMcdC-b9rMe39c-.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>008 位毛&amp;嘉慧&amp;大表哥：AGI时代的生存、生产、生活、生娃</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6720ebb5cbe0e69c8b961dd1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6720ebb5cbe0e69c8b961dd1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Oct 2024 14:38:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期录制于户外，恰逢街对面小学放学，有些许嘈杂，已经通过后期魔法尽可能减小噪音。</span></p><span></span><p><span>位毛、嘉慧、大表哥，是曾经在一起工作的三剑客。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 每天有效工作时间大概就两三个小时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a> 位毛：世界就是一场大型的以工代赈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="314">05:14</a> chatGPT极大地提升了产品经理实现想法的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="777">12:57</a> 嘉慧：如果你有10万预算，你想请8+2还是5*2的员工？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="983">16:23</a> 为什么大家一定要挤大厂？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 职业培训学校进行一个信息差的上下忽悠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">21:44</a> 假设没有经济压力，你想干什么事儿？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">26:31</a> 秩序只是既得利益者对于另一部分人的剥削罢了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a> 大表哥：习惯杭州物价以后，出国也没有觉得很贵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1724">28:44</a> 乡镇的经济衰退更显性，旧的死了新的没有顶上来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1852">30:52</a> 社会上的钱需要流动起来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">33:12</a> 发达病来得太早了，因为人多呀——</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2296">38:16</a> 为什么很多承包商的交付质量越来越差了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2473">41:13</a> 像过去一样买断自己所有时间还可行吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2564">42:44</a> IC（Individual Contributor）在中国可能存在吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2595">43:15</a> 互联网行业工资高吗？不高吗？高吗？不高吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3160">52:40</a> 小事计较，大事盲目的普通人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3510">58:30</a> 你要生孩子吗——大表哥竟然开启了这个话题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">65:00</a> 觉得世界没意思的人才完蛋了，没有欲望的欲望癌，要治啊</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljrfQPJpyLpuLk-baoUY7_JDyFut.m4a" length="136501404" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:10:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuOy2BUu0CLHxxMcdC-b9rMe39c-.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>007 位毛&amp;肉肉&amp;浩浩：如果步调不统一，打球恋爱都不行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671e2c52eb46cd665515bf2f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671e2c52eb46cd665515bf2f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Oct 2024 12:04:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本次对话在舟山岱山岛的民宿中录制，我们一起在台风天看海，哈啤酒。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 三个人单身时长5年:5年:5年，难道和经济周期有关？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> 疫情期间没有和异性关在一个房间里导致没有谈恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a> 位毛暴言：因为恋爱就改变社交体系的人是易叛变体质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="257">04:17</a> 位毛：我喜欢组织朋友们一起玩，但往往大家会不了了之</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="336">05:36</a> 位毛复盘反思整个组织羽毛球活动的一些自我折磨的心理历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="839">13:59</a> 浩浩：合家欢和一起进步本身就是互相矛盾的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 浩浩：我从个人（一个专业的HRBP）的角度认为应该公开抛出问题讨论清楚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">20:03</a> 肉肉：我不愿意参加线下兴趣活动，因为专业性大于趣味性了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1364">22:44</a> 三个人同声：亲密关系就是有期待就会有失望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1726">28:46</a> 肉肉：朋友有对象以后，我就和他们的对象交朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2155">35:55</a> 所谓的共同兴趣并非先有兴趣再有匹配，而是在一起培养</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2267">37:47</a> 肉肉想要这样的对象：________</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2373">39:33</a> 浩浩：很多人既渴望恋爱，又要给自己不恋爱进行合理化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2572">42:52</a> 时空恋旅人：Marry someone kind.</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2622">43:42</a> 位毛：普通的人生最简单，因为长达18年的人生课题已经被安排好了</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>汉堡黄 - # ###，</span><br><span>汉堡黄 - 0，</span><br><span>汉堡黄 - I hope I wake up as some one new(Demo)，</span><br><span>汉堡黄 - shut up and listen，</span><br><span>汉堡黄 - sometime,somewhere，</span><br><span>汉堡黄 - tgalaxy!!! (Demo)，</span><br><span>汉堡黄 - 一起，</span><br><span>汉堡黄 - 乌鸦，</span><br><span>汉堡黄 - 努奇猫，</span><br><span>汉堡黄 - 你出现，</span><br><span>汉堡黄 - 假想敌，</span><br><span>汉堡黄 - 当你穿过我的身体，</span><br><span>汉堡黄 - 快一点，慢一点，</span><br><span>汉堡黄,鶴 The Crane - nightmare freestyle (ft.鹤The Crane)</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luvoO8ezlOnH4k9aW5p-xyT8zg3e.m4a" length="95189008" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuOy2BUu0CLHxxMcdC-b9rMe39c-.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>006 位毛：只有我一个人觉得这个城市已经死掉了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6718f00a0d2f24f2894fd6b1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6718f00a0d2f24f2894fd6b1</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 23 Oct 2024 12:46:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 大家坏！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13">00:13</a> 我感觉我生活的城市像死了一样，身边都是死人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a> we总说12年前，城市和我们都很有活力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a> 网络环境变差了，经济环境也变差了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">06:11</a> 俺の微博封号されて</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="402">06:42</a> 俺の小红书封号されて</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="525">08:45</a> 什么变态会这么精细化地搞微信分组啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">10:42</a> 为什么很多人私底下也不愿意表达了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> 贷款还清了，一切会好起来吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">14:24</a> 我读《资本论》的个人感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a> 一个年光五十万的人，如何失去了所有消费欲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1137">18:57</a> 能够花钱达成的目标才是最简单的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> 终于明白我是无产阶级不是中产阶级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1505">25:05</a> 磨洋工的人竟然是无产阶级战士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1542">25:42</a> 这个世间唯一平等的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1624">27:04</a> 过去认为没有价值的东西，逐渐治愈、解救了被资本主义异化的我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1722">28:42</a> 去个活人多的地方吧</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgAF1OS8zEmgYUExSUzWV4qyNP8P.m4a" length="58228528" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:30:09</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuOy2BUu0CLHxxMcdC-b9rMe39c-.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
