    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Oct 2024 10:34:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一切以杭州为例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 国际歌，起！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a> 一个月2241块钱的失业保险金，能领20个月！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 最重要的条件：不要主动辞职！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 社会平均工资：教育教育你什么叫不公平</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">03:45</a> 什么是N+1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> 什么时候办失业保险金领取？在哪里申请？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 超级坏蛋公司和一般坏蛋公司</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">07:27</a> GAP期间医保和养老保险要怎么交？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">08:08</a> 灵活就业社保+医保</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">09:05</a> 熟悉政策，保护权益，祝君快乐GAP</span></p>]]></description>
