  <item>
    <title>003 杭州爱上西雅图，IT圈老友的线上茶话会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f8d9e881cdab3a93d48783</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f8d9e881cdab3a93d48783</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Sep 2024 04:39:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>四个相识长达10年+的老男人（本来五个，有一个被娃缠住了）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>杨总</span></strong><span>：普通话最好听的那个；</span><br><span></span><strong><span>昕爷</span></strong><span>：杭普的那个；</span><br><span></span><strong><span>Nemo</span></strong><span>：没睡醒的那个（人在西雅图8A.M.）</span><br><span></span><strong><span>位毛</span></strong><span>：音质最好的那个，因为是本地录制；</span><br><span></span><strong><span>鱼总</span></strong><span>：没出现，被娃缠住了</span></p><span></span><p><span>导听：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开机调试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> 先聊摩托车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="167">02:47</a> 推介台剧《八尺门的辩护人》、讨论台剧和奈飞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> 聊贾樟柯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 开始玩MacOS的摄像头特效，Studio Display屏幕追踪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="431">07:11</a> 关于美国摩托车、交通的聊天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 我一脚踹掉了网线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a> 昕爷上线了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> 微微一提iPhone16</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a> 从Meta Rayban智能眼镜聊到启用门槛对产品的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a> 西雅图的搬家与通勤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1456">24:16</a> 聊电动汽车，后面又接着聊西雅图租房</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> Ne总聊小费文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1946">32:26</a> 晚安！</span></p>]]></description>
