  <item>
    <title>002 札幌、函馆、久慈、东京、京都，去日本玩呀！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f57c8969b6a485e82b4a84</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f57c8969b6a485e82b4a84</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 26 Sep 2024 15:23:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>男声：</span><strong><span>位毛</span></strong><span>，2018年末去日本，从札幌一路玩到东京，在东京塔下跨年；</span><br><span>女声：</span><strong><span>小鱼</span></strong><span>，最近才从日本回来，14天9000块的超省之旅。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 两个人的不同路线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 小鱼日本之行的动机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 仔细想想成田机场的位置很萧山机场啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 居民区为啥那么好看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">10:06</a> 成田山新胜寺和咱的径山寺，结缘价15万！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a> 咱们哪里都是曼哈顿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">16:37</a> 位毛的北海道旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a> 文明国家的安全感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1312">21:52</a> 扫码点单真的烦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 最重要的海女久慈之行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1476">24:36</a> 日本的铁路真的复杂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 超离谱的富士山包车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2434">40:34</a> 日常辱杭州菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 小鱼和以色列小伙子阿瑟夫的故事</span></p>]]></description>
